message: "If you use this software or experimental protocol, please cite the associated paper when available."
title: "Adaptive Plasticity Routing"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/in-c0/plasticity-routing"
abstract: >-
  Pre-result research scaffold for learned, resource-aware write-depth allocation
  in continual agents. Investigates whether a policy can learn which substrate
  should absorb a new experience, from delayed future utility, under interference
  and storage/compute constraints. No empirical claim is made yet.
